      ⍝ A negative precision is scaled form, to that many digits.
      9 ¯2⍕B
   1.2E01  ¯3.5E01
  0.0E¯01   1.2E01
 ¯2.6E¯01  ¯1.2E02
      ⍝ A width of 0 leaves one space between numbers; one number is a
      ⍝ precision with a width of 0.
